Welcome to our
breakout session, where

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:17.570
we'll talk about the six
incredibly powerful GKE

00:00:17.570 --> 00:00:20.100
capabilities you
may have missed.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.610
It's a fun session packed
with cutting-edge tech

00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:25.820
and a demo of our
newest capabilities.

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:26.960
My name is Jerzy.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.550
And today with me is Roman.

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:31.640
Both of us are product managers
on Google Kubernetes Engine

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:32.479
team.

00:00:32.479 --> 00:00:36.500
Together, we will learn
how using GKE and adopting

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:41.165
the right culture can
help customers like Ubie,

00:00:41.165 --> 00:00:43.580
a Japan-based health
care technology startup

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:46.580
that automatically generates
medical records using

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:49.280
