cluster setup guide.

00:15:12.070 --> 00:15:15.940
The setup guide helps build
a GKE standard cluster

00:15:15.940 --> 00:15:19.210
with all the best infrastructure
level cost optimization

00:15:19.210 --> 00:15:23.400
